# The following CVEs/GHSAs are reported exclusively by upstream Docker official
# base image static SBOMs for vendored packages that have already been cleanly
# upgraded or replaced in the final image layers:
# ==============================================================================

# Python official Docker image embedded SBOM false positives (upgraded via pip)
